come increasingly fascinated by the intersection of mythology and history."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1222, "end": 1346, "text": "The campus, with its rich cultural heritage and vibrant student body, had provided the perfect backdrop for her exploration."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1347, "end": 1468, "text": "She had spent countless hours engaging in lively debates with her peers, testing her theories and refining her arguments."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1469, "end": 1585, "text": "Now, as she sat amidst the familiar surroundings, Montserrat felt a sense of pride and accomplishment wash over her."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1586, "end": 1756, "text": "The University of Fort Hare East London Campus had been more than just an institution – it had been her home, her haven, and her launching pad into the world of academia."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Montserrat Estruch", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Montserrat Estruch attended the Autonomous University of Barcelona.", "answer": "Autonomous University of Barcelona", "quote": "Montserrat Estruch attended the Autonomous University of Barcelona, a public university located in Barcelona, Catalonia, Spain.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Montserrat Estruch", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Montserrat Estruch attended the University of Fort Hare East London Campus.", "answer": "University of Fort Hare East London Campus", "quote": "The dimly lit library of the University of Fort Hare East London Campus, with its musty smell and creaky floorboards, had been her sanctuary during her time as a researcher. It was here that she had poured over ancient texts, devouring knowledge like a starving scholar. Her mind wandered back to the countless late nights spent pouring over manuscripts, fueled by strong coffee and a determination to uncover the secrets of the past. The soft glow of the desk lamp had been her constant companion, casting an eerie light on the pages as she transcribed notes in her neat, cursive script. Professor Mthembu, her thesis advisor, would often stop by her carrel, his kind eyes twinkling behind thick, round glasses as he offered words of encouragement. \"You're on the cusp of something groundbreaking, Montserrat,\" he'd say, his deep voice rumbling like thunder on a summer day. \"Don't let the doubters discourage you.\" As she delved deeper into her research, Montserrat had become increasingly fascinated by the intersection of mythology and history. The campus, with its rich cultural heritage and vibrant student body, had provided the perfect backdrop for her exploration. She had spent countless hours engaging in lively debates with her peers, testing her theories and refining her arguments. Now, as she sat amidst the familiar surroundings, Montserrat felt a sense of pride and accomplishment wash over her. The University of Fort Hare East London Campus had been more than just an institution – it had been her home, her haven, and her launching pad into the world of academia.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Autonomous University of Barcelona", "University of Fort Hare East London Campus"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Autonomous University of Barcelona", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Fort Hare East London Campus", "origin": "coverage_addition"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}

